## Operator review checklist

- [ ] All seven foundational features have a concrete realisation in this scaffold.
- [ ] No real AWS account IDs in any committed file; placeholders use `123456789012`.
- [ ] Control Tower vs LZA decision is explicit and justified.
- [ ] SCPs present at the OU level (not inside the workload account).
- [ ] OIDC trust policies bound to specific repos and refs (not wildcard).
